    'body' => <<<'HTML'
<div class="key-takeaways"><h2>Key takeaways</h2><ul>
<li>A hail damage claim supplement asks the carrier to add missed, under-measured, or newly discovered items to its estimate. It is a routine part of many roof claims.</li>
<li>Commonly missed items include tear-off of additional layers, starter course, drip edge, ridge cap, pipe jacks, vents, step flashing, steep or high-roof charges, and decking found during tear-off.</li>
<li>Every supplement item needs proof: photos, measurements, manufacturer or code requirements, and a clear explanation.</li>
